                        <a name="vendors1">Who are vendors?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Vendors</h1>
                        <p>Vendors are too members who take a greater degree of control of universally marketable products and services.</p>
                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
                        <br />
                        <a name="vendors2">Working with vendors</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Patronizing Vendors</h1>
                        <p>Working with vendors is easy. You will see the natural products that have been produced by our vendors.</p>
                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
                        <br />
                        <a name="vendors3">Do vendors sell to anyone?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Vendors Sales</h1>
                        <p>Although we count our vendors as members they are a free market enterprise. Our member growers will eventually outgrow the sales of products to the co-operative and we will be there to support their growth.</p>
                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
                        <a name="shipping1">How do I recieve my items?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Shipping</h1>
                        <p>Orders for fresh vegetables and fruits that are perishable can only be ordered from with-in your pod. Our Member Drive &trade; co-operative members fill and close orders in as little as one hour.</p>
                        <p>
                            Our goal is to never create orders that cannot be filled in less than an hour. Due to the perishable nature of our grower member products over 50% of products will not be shipped out side of your pod. Location services on the market page ensures that we meet our goals of creating a responsive farm market experience. Our vision of a farm market without doors and
                            walls or any restrictions of your typical grocery store.
                        </p>
                        <p>For our grower members who purchase products from growers who produce products with a greater shelf life will be made available to you automatically on the market page without restrictions.</p>
                        <div class="img-responsive">
                            <div class="row">
                                <p class="imgholder"><span><img src="~/KnowledgeShots/10.png" alt="picture" /></span></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p>While in the marketplace select a particular item from vendor.</p>
                        <div class="img-responsive">
                            <div class="row">
                                <p class="imgholder"><span><img src="~/KnowledgeShots/select.png" alt="picture" /></span></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p>Verify and confirm your order.</p>
